{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_05_end",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_05",
  "title": "拙山",
  "storyCode": "WR-5",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5dac47c92ec1fb434de7e55059b2c291e2c91eba742b8c3626667290504c68b8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "别过来！别过来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "它、它吃掉了我的手，哈、哈哈，我怎么一点感觉不到疼，我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "噫——别过来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你没事吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你为什么才来！！为什么没有人敲钟！那个守岁的僧人去哪儿了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "明明是信任你们，才按你们说的去做的，为什么！为什么我丈夫会死！你们要怎么赔，要怎么赔！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......先离开这里再说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "唔啊啊——妈妈，妈妈，你还我妈妈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "唔哦！这次也是千钧一发啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "叔、叔叔，妈妈，妈妈——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "先不论这个小家伙，外面好像有些不得了的大玩意啊，小姑娘，抓好了，咱们要开溜了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊——！嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "又来一只！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "根本、根本解决不完！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "它们到底是从哪里冒出来的......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "不行，这个数量，根本不可能全部拦得住——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "虽是画中物，倒也不必如此赶尽杀绝......此般景象，看得直教人捶胸顿足。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "炎熔施主，这里有小僧看着，快去带他人避难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "无需担心小僧，小僧在此地游历数载，虽对未来之事有了种种念想，忧虑不定——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "——但小僧未有一刻，对身前之事有分毫惘然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "此地，交给小僧罢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......嗯。继续往东边走，你结束了找我们汇合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧在此，莫要向前一步！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "过此界者，当斩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "唔啊啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "哎哟！我的小姑奶奶！能不能别揪我的头发了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "妈妈——妈妈——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "这玩意就会嘎嘎嘎地叫，这么能追你怎么不吐几句人话呢！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "......别......跑......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "哎呀妈呀，我就说着玩的，不必如此，大可不必如此呀——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "呜呜呜，叔叔，前、前面！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "呃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "咿呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你、你是那个算命的......？其他两位英雄在哪儿呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你身后，身后！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你怎么把它们引来了！你快想想办法——想想办法啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "我能想什么办法！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你把它们引开，引开啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "我......我也......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "呜呜呜，呜啊啊啊，妈妈，妈妈——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "哎哟，快别哭了！别哭！丫头，别哭了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "啊！那些东西看过来了！你快去啊，你快去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎啊啊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "欸......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "用、用扇子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "......你们躲远点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎嗷？嘎啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "]"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "一招就......！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嗷！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "厉、厉害......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "哎哟哟，疼死我了疼死我了，这些玩意到底是什么，怎么看着软绵绵的，打上去这么厚实呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "欸，别看我啦，俗话说得好，驮兽急了也咬人，咱们还是赶紧跑路吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "text": "嘎嗷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "哎呀，虽然拳脚功夫不错，但小乌有你从来没有在这种情况下救人的经验吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "只解决眼前的敌人而不注意全方位的动静，迟早会吃亏的哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "啊、啊哈哈......刚才可真险呐！多亏了恩人，我才能安然无恙呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "......好啦，赶紧带着剩下的人避难去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "呃，恩人您？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "我？没关系，我脚步很轻，它们发现不了我的啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "（就这身手，脚步轻就能解释得了吗！？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "之后......该怎么迅速削减这些墨魉的数量呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "咿呀！园、园子里的火光是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "唔哦！火光冲天，蔚为壮观！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "唔？莫非“炎熔”二字，便取此中意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "小炎熔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......帮我确定附近所有敌人的分布范围。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "这么大阵仗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "本来担心波及到周遭的建筑，一直不怎么敢随便用法术......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......但敌人太多了，这样慢吞吞对付下去，受害者数量恐怕难以估量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "明白，特殊时期特殊手段嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "我去找个高处，你就安心施法吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "所有超出法术范围的敌人我都会帮忙解决的，保证一个不落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "之后的任务报告我来提交......毕竟罗德岛该帮助的，不止是感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "感染者......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "嗯......没什么，在此之前，小炎熔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "你有看到煮伞先生吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
